  <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
    {[['🔴 P0','偏航级联断开','control.c：pidRateZ.desired 未赋值、pidYaw.out 被丢弃 → 航向失控（飞行最大阻断点）'],
      ['🟠 P1','初始化死循环风险','MpuInit/NRF24L01_init 内 do-while(FAILED)，传感器缺件即卡死'],
      ['🟠 P1','WiFi 遥控失效','Uart1.c 解析被注释 + WIFI_UFO.c 一键动作只置标志不执行'],
      ['⚠ 提示','命名误导但逻辑正确','RC_Analy 的 Nrf_Erro==1 实为"有信号"，非写反']].map((d,i)=>(
      <Box key={i} style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#0F1E33', padding: '14px 22px', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: i===0? '4px solid #FF5A5A':'4px solid #4A90D9' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: i===0? '#FF7A7A':'#7FB0E8', fontWeight: 700, width: 110 }}>{d[0]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E8F0FA', fontWeight: 600, width: 220 }}>{d[1]}</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9DB4CE', flex: 1, lineHeight: 1.45 }}>{d[2]}</Text>
      </Box>
    ))}
    <Box style={{ background: '#0F1E33', borderLeft: '4px solid #00D1FF', padding: '10px 20px', borderRadius: 8 }}>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8F0FA' }}>互动预留：若让你补全偏航控制，会改 control.c 哪几行？——引导听众动手思考。</Text>
